## Research limits

`SOURCE-REVIEW.md` distinguishes primary documents, collection/authoritative contextual sources, and inferences. Sources were inspected, not every original-language textual variant collated. No complete new Atlantis-of-civilizations claim: this bounded addition strengthens one missing connective spine.

The preserved In Our Time derivative findings and metadata were consulted, not a recovered abstract compendium. `episode-directions.json` contains six bibliographic pointers for optional later exploration; these are **not** claims of newly listened-to or close-read episodes. The old 29-lead mining already explained why the science/art threads were present. Salt/Longitude/Guns, Germs, and Steel were inspiration, not a mandatory book checklist.
